tyfinder.ae/en/rent/abu-dhabi/apartments-for-rent-masdar-city.html","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"Guide averages are AED 74k / 96k / 152k annually for 1 / 2 / 3 bedroom apartments."},{"id":"pf_rabdan","publisher":"Property Finder","url":"https://www.propertyfinder.ae/en/rent/abu-dhabi/apartments-for-rent-rabdan.html","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"Visible annual apartment examples include one 1BR at AED 74,999 and one 2BR at AED 90,000. Used as a clearly labeled nearby-area proxy for Abu Dhabi Gate small apartments."},{"id":"pf_bloom_townhouse","publisher":"Property Finder","url":"https://www.propertyfinder.ae/en/rent/abu-dhabi/3-bedroom-townhouses-for-rent-al-salam-street-bloom-gardens.html","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"Visible 3BR townhouse asks span approximately AED 179,600-220,000 annually."},{"id":"pf_bloom_villa","publisher":"Property Finder","url":"https://www.propertyfinder.ae/en/rent/abu-dhabi/3-bedroom-villas-for-rent-al-salam-street-bloom-gardens.html","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"Visible 3BR villa asks are approximately AED 204,750-210,000 annually; kept separate from small-apartment pricing."},{"id":"pf_reem","publisher":"Property Finder","url":"https://www.propertyfinder.ae/en/rent/abu-dhabi/apartments-for-rent-al-reem-island.html","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"Guide averages are approximately AED 101k / 137k / 156k annually for 1 / 2 / 3 bedroom apartments."},{"id":"bayut_gate_coverage","publisher":"Bayut","url":"https://www.bayut.com/to-rent/apartments/abu-dhabi/abu-dhabi-gate-city-officers-city/","accessed_on":"2026-10-02","evidence_summary":"The requested-area page showed no matching properties and then recommended other areas. Those recommendations were not treated as listings inside Abu Dhabi Gate."}]}$second_start_json$::jsonb, '99e1c28416c84108');
